{"asset_key":"ep5/quest_story_15210310","episode":"ep5","category":"quest_story","story_id":"15210310","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:1:1521031001:0":{"text":"若様、どうされました……？","source_cn":"小公子，您怎么……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA0464710B01D34CF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1521031002:0":{"text":"さっき、カトーが何を聞きたがっていたのか知りたいのだ。それから、そなたが言った噂もな。","source_cn":"我想知道卡托刚刚想问什么。唔……还有你说的那些流言。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x80924A95CA75963C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1521031003:0":{"text":"案ずるな。そなたらが何を言っても余は怒ったりはしない……えっと、それから誰にも言わないと約束しよう。","source_cn":"不管你们说什么，我都不会生气——呃，也不会告诉其他人。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x16D5937E5F5CD163","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1521031004:0":{"text":"……本当に？","source_cn":"……真的吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD7634858F19B91C7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1521031005:1":{"text":"カトー……","source_cn":"卡托……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC8B9463FA02EEDCD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1521031006:1":{"